  `target_height` respectively, this op centrally crops along that dimension.

  For example:

  >>> image = np.arange(75).reshape(5, 5, 3)  # create 3-D image input
  >>> image[:,:,0]  # print first channel just for demo purposes
  array([[ 0,  3,  6,  9, 12],
