  Returns:
    Cropped and/or padded image.
    If `images` was 4-D, a 4-D float Tensor of shape
    `[batch, new_height, new_width, channels]`.
    If `images` was 3-D, a 3-D float Tensor of shape
    `[new_height, new_width, channels]`.

